  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Astropolis/BH_Astropolis_Header.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Astropolis/BH_Astropolis_Overview.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e6c201ec-eab5-4966-ac31-fd785a6b88e0.webp\" width=\"1122\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Astropolis/BH_Astropolis_Features.png\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UpJknJ8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Astropolis/BH_Astropolis_Discord.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Astropolis 是一款基於任務的太空 Minecraft 1.19.2 整合包。穿梭於宇宙、小行星帶與不同的星球之間，最終返回地球。擁有全新模組、新功能、新方塊與機器。收錄了 Cosmopolis、Essence、Geodeopolis、Mekanism、Compact Machines 等眾多模組。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>可視為《Caveopolis》(1.18.2) 的續作&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>前往不同星球取得新資源，探索遙遠的疆域</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>加入 Discord 以回報錯誤、問題或提供建議</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UpJknJ8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/UpJknJ8</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>特別感謝 Discord 和 Planet Minecraft 上的 @WorldSaladDev，感謝他提供的精彩世界：<br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fworldsaladdev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/worldsaladdev/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>點擊下方圖片即可擁有你自己的伺服器。使用優惠碼：<strong>&nbsp;skyopolis</strong>&nbsp;可享<strong>25% 折扣</strong>。4GB 方案非常適合此整合包：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dr8MaQ-1M2M?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
